OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of fish released in
OL,4,AThames to top up stock
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of young fish have been
OL,7,Freleased into the River Thames to help
OL,8,Ftop up the population and attract
OL,9,Fanglers.
OL,11,FThe 400 barbel were put into the river
OL,12,Fat Temple Lock in Marlow,
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, on Tuesday as part of
OL,14,Fthe Environment Agency's (EA) annual
OL,15,Fwinter stocking programme to help boost
OL,16,Ffish stocks and support angling across
OL,17,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
