OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of fish released in
OL,4,AThames to top up stock
OL,5,
OL,6,FRod licence money is being used for the
OL,7,Fnew local project - a three-year
OL,8,Fprogramme that will see 1,200 barbel
OL,9,Freleased into the Thames between Temple
OL,10,FLock and Marlow.
OL,12,F"This winter's releases are a fantastic
OL,13,Fboost for our rivers, still waters and
OL,14,Flocal angling clubs," said EA's area
OL,15,Ffisheries manager Peter Gray.
